#: ../../visualization.rst:159
msgid "**NORMAL Mode**: Full cursor navigation with ``h``/``j``/``k``/``l``, word jump ``w``/``b``, line bounds ``0``/``$``, file bounds ``gg``/``G``, delete character ``x``, delete line ``dd``, copy line ``yy``, paste ``p``, undo ``u``, redo ``Ctrl+r``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../visualization.rst:160
msgid "**INSERT Mode**: Press ``i``, ``a``, or ``o`` to write code freely. Press ``Esc`` to return to NORMAL mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../visualization.rst:161
